;; Observations for the xtdb-embedded-node skill, made by
;; `clojure -M:eval storage xtdb-embedded-node` from evals/. Every check runs
;; against the classpath's xtdb-core, with no container:
;; - most start a node in the eval's own process from a Clojure node map;
;; - `flight-sql-first-map-ignored`, `flight-sql-require-first`,
;;   `storage-v06` and the `block-` checks
;;   start one in a new JVM on the same classpath, with all, none or one of
;;   the JVM options XTDB's docs give;
;; - `ledger-from-core` and `license-dir-and-file` read the classpath;
;; - the `uber-` checks and `tcnative-from-flight-sql` run `clojure -M:uber`
;;   (xtdb-eval.uber), which builds uberjars of that xtdb-core with
;;   tools.build in a JVM of its own and starts a node from one.
;; Each example names one fact it checks.
{:skill "../../skills/xtdb-embedded-node/SKILL.md"

